 using them to avoid name-space collisions.
 
+ad	Avionic Design GmbH
 adi	Analog Devices, Inc.
 amcc	Applied Micro Circuits Corporation (APM, formally AMCC)
 apm	Applied Micro Circuits Corporation (APM)
